    "q-65178": {
      "dom_id": "step-q65178",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "If $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3},$ then $\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-2\\pi )-2=$",
      "worked_solution": "The period of $y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$ is $2\\pi .$ Therefore, for an integer $n$ we have\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+2n\\pi ).\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=-1$ into the right-hand-side gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-2\\pi ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, if $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3},$ then $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-2\\pi )=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}.$\n\nFinally, then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-2\\pi )-2 & =\\sqrt{5}(\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3})-2 \\\\  & =\\frac{{(\\sqrt{5})}^{2}}{3}-2 \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{3}-2 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-65178-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "-\\frac{1}{3}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"70\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-65178-b",
